    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f20ca592f507a9fe71ff9b92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了解决双涡轮讨厌闸门的问题，\n他们请来了人称“铁娘子”的生野狄杜斯。\n她是擅长管理的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25618d68bd03beec9957212eba21de2b8d7337f093b2d6b907170b667c9b64e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
