      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f205bc69ce39faa6efd490aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "乍看之下，会觉得弱点应该加以改善。\n但生野狄杜斯认为“改善的效果是有限的”，\n于是听从她的建言──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b28f028e71126472a24ca196b8364fa7ca10f10cc263788702486d39dab7d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ac3307c3f4617e14f1c631",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:046145e8c4c87b4b32e56a00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员转换方向，\n反过来活用弱点。\n将讨厌闸门的情绪，成功转为起跑冲刺的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "542d52a086f2afb9d848edd828acf395227e89e5ed54282f5d8c7d269ab8fe37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16ef299cc4ac5cdc798c1f7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066401.json",
      "json_path": [
