    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f0c4407ec8b8963e6329a14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伙伴增加后，双涡轮“胆小”的问题解决了。\n但她却在模拟赛连吃败仗。\n另一方面──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b1d867c9248f6ef6c3fdc1467e5160f2dbf50204e672fbaf99e2e63a93ac044",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63e6fa5353263a0c6210fcc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee60c7d1efeae8ffd0c5dc4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王的出道也迟迟定不下来。\n为参加经典三冠一事蒙上阴霾……\n但她本人没有放弃，仍持续努力着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "661c65ac3effe3361209d7f012ec399815d03092fa6b4e7e96a570dd787813bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b269a0032406b5074a14d3f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502fe27ab9ce24337a57e11f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双涡轮因为她锲而不舍的精神受到刺激。\n心中再一次点燃了火焰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3fe13e858052b5aae3c9d248d78f129b7dbede44383c24ceb995a6ec992c151",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0040babbf53f62bc578bb6c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不会输给劲敌的",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee2d7adea58870a363fe8f20f6c7437df20c1b3a21307baf66459ace16c0fcf1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ed3711ba745b65061a4350d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ecfd70b9f19a324285bb2b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双涡轮得到大拓太阳神指点跑法。\n于是在跑法中加入了“节奏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "524c53bd2c0083c4ac52678be9a1f7b1b8d24ac28bdca024192de53c6f1dca96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ca1771b7e1b5df1e8edabb2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc301a34950153abd0406f92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然考虑过她或许也能跑短距离路线，\n但她的优势并不是速度，而是“不顾一切”。\n于是目标就定在中距离以上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50b752d18890a21989375763771ba4f24077b7db2a93d50fe9bb2e8ca3a9396c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40eaa46f3839319a4e60ff65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f73da3d1f125a08b3ef85457",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着东海帝王也在出道战获得首胜，\n让双涡轮更有干劲了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f67db012e105563752461baded0fc1f3bbbc7359eb7da35e26d6fd65151e41d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2c13be302410a12f7851576",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "打破领头的阻碍吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8450589c159f258010efd1f3555937aa5a5b5f0c6957a6a61c480b1a8b2c7f89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85eee881311d8fefed7d0aaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东海帝王放弃了“菊花赏”，\n但她本人正为了下个梦想继续训练，\n不放弃自己的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a063b33b1e50aa24d5517e23fb05c5432bd03be00128266863ea126b2d6a89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb231f5c951b5bf150f27c9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双涡轮也将这件事告诉优秀素质等人。\n于是大家决定累积实力，\n为东海帝王的复出做准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74273f82539caa99463f7f62f33108ee759a62a97f6b2e3041312d049f2163ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f6491b404ff43b0ba6a970",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外，待兼诗歌剧也成为了伙伴！\n双涡轮干劲十足地想指引她走出低潮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f6cb844e7a4bff85517f29d16ae073979d045721c8f56b881f19a620cbd7c36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37f7e3cc40eadeffbc40afe1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下个目标是，在明年五月以前达成\n“在GⅢ以上的竞赛，跑进第三名以内三次”。\n或许可以再加上参加今年的“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6c3fbaf57011fc902d911906f00e28e389bea0fb6db7f62d8185482370eaff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41558383fc865855d3b3edf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "涡轮相信你喔，帝王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eba4b301637c393bb458d116bee757af6c6bde858506b30f71386e4079ef2d45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
